# Links that the link check of this repository skips, one regular expression per
# line, each with its reason above it. The rules of every repository are in lychee.toml.

# The pictures of the documentation on main, which a pull request that adds one can't
# show yet; tests/test_docs.py checks that each one exists.
^https://raw\.githubusercontent\.com/Dennis-Otto/issue-assistant/main/docs/images/

# The pages of the documentation on main, which a pull request that adds one can't
# link yet; lychee asks raw.githubusercontent.com for them (lychee.toml), and
# tests/test_docs.py checks that each one exists.
^https://(github\.com/Dennis-Otto/issue-assistant/blob|raw\.githubusercontent\.com/Dennis-Otto/issue-assistant)/main/docs/[^#?]+\.md
